5. Icon assets (not shipped in this closure)
-------------------------------------------

`gpui-kit-assets@0.6.6` (Cargo.lock checksum
`111d3d03a68454318a193f137419864ccebdc7d3dc0194b0b0b3f818a6bc3d55`)
is outside this closure, so no Lucide or Feather icons ship with it.
The pinned source contains `LICENSE-LUCIDE` (Lucide ISC text plus the
Feather MIT text for the listed Feather-derived icons). If a future
feature set ships `gpui-kit-assets`, both copyright notices and
permission texts must be preserved and this NOTICE regenerated.

6. Out of scope for this NOTICE
-------------------------------

- Other targets, other feature sets, and the upstream union lockfile.
- Nix system libraries (fontconfig, freetype, libxkbcommon, XCB, Mesa,
  Vulkan loader, GTK/WebKitGTK on the Tauri path): separate runtime
  closure review required.
- No git sources exist in this closure; every non-path package is a
  pinned crates.io registry package.

